% Regression test for https://github.com/knowsys/nemo/issues/483: a
% recursive rule with comparisons, over a predicate that mixes integers
% and strings in a column. Rows used to be lost.

rep(2, 2) .
rep(-10, "a") .
rep(-2, -2) .

P(-2) .
P(1) .
P(3) .

P(?i) :- rep(?i, _), P(?k), P(?l), ?i >= ?k, ?i <= ?l, ?l - ?k < 3 .
